      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: magic ring, 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc each. Round 3: * 2 dc, 1 dc; rep. Continue to 6.5 cm. BLO fold round."
